[{"client_msg_id":"d21a920a-db3c-4364-8d33-7a774408445d","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"done","ts":"1631142157.035400","thread_ts":"1631142157.035400","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"cat-dogeza-mike","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xDJ"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U024GRZRJ3B","ts":"1631142103.035100","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"[vim-jp/issues] Issue opened by Milly","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/issues/issues/1377|#1377 gvim.exe で ConPty と DirectX の組み合わせ時に :terminal の描画が遅くなる\u003e","pretext":"New issue created by \u003chttps://github.com/Milly|Milly\u003e","text":"*不具合の内容*\n\nWindows の gvim.exe において、 `set termwintype=conpty renderoptions=type:directx` のオプションを組み合わせた場合に `:terminal` の描画が遅くなる。\n\n*現象・ログ*\n*遅くなる例*\n\n`set termwintype=conpty renderoptions=type:directx` (ConPty + DirectX)\n\ngvim-conpty-directx.mp4\n*遅くならない例*\n\n`set termwintype=conpty renderoptions=` (ConPty + GDI)\n\ngvim-conpty-gdi.mp4\n*再現手順*\n\n```\ngvim.exe -u NONE -U NONE -c \"set nocompatible termwintype=conpty renderoptions=type:directx\" -c \"terminal ++curwin\"\n```\n\n• gvim.exe のサイズを大きくする (:terminal のウィンドウが広いほど遅くなる)\n• `dir` を実行\n• `color256` を実行\n• `color24` を実行\n• `cls` を実行\n\n*color256.bat*\n\n```\n@echo off\nsetlocal EnableDelayedExpansion\n\nset val=\nset str=\nfor /l %%i in (0,1,15) do (\n        for /l %%j in (0,1,15) do (\n                set /a val=%%i * 16 + %%j\n                set val=00!val!\n                set val=!val:~-3!\n                set str=!str! al!m!val!\n        )\n        echo !str!\n        set str=\n)\n```\n\n*color24.bat*\n\n```\n@echo off\nsetlocal EnableDelayedExpansion\n\nset str=\nfor /l %%i in (0,32,255) do (\n        for /l %%j in (0,32,255) do (\n                for /l %%k in (0,32,255) do (\n                        set str=!str!;%%j;%%km\n                )\n        )\n        echo !str!\n        set str=\n)\n```\n\n*期待動作*\n\n`set termwintype=conpty renderoptions=` (ConPty + GDI) と同等の速度で動作して欲しい。\n\n*Vimのバージョン*\n\n8.2.3361\n\n*OSの種類/ディストリ/バージョン*\n\nWindows 10 Pro 64bit 20H2 (19042.1165)\n\n*使用している or 関係していそうなプラグイン*\n\n無し\n\n*その他*\n\n• `termwintype=conpty renderoptions=type:directx` (ConPty + DirectX) → 遅くなる\n• `termwintype=conpty renderoptions=` (ConPty + GDI) → 遅くならない\n• `termwintype= renderoptions=type:directx` (winpty + DirectX) → 遅くならない\n• `termwintype= renderoptions=` (winpty + GDI) → 遅くならない","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/issues|vim-jp/issues\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1631142101}],"bot_id":"B02415KRKPX","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"85cf78db-c257-415e-aa0a-59aa566ba2b2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003c@UP6PA1UBE\u003e いちおうissue作っておいてもらえませんか?\n\n先ほどの動画とそのスクリプト添付してもらえると再現性があがって助かります。\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-jp/issues/issues/new?assignees=\u0026amp;labels=\u0026amp;template=bugreport.md\u0026amp;title=\u003e","ts":"1631140519.035000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yGQYD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b17801fb-631e-4739-afa4-c3ca1415f66a","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"conpty はいまだに experimental みたいな扱いなので、しかたないといえばそう","ts":"1631140386.034300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QBpps"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95c40de9-1990-4485-be06-76cfa58a6167","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとデフォルトでwinptyになってて気が付かんかった。","ts":"1631140350.033700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ex9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65032160-e7e7-496a-a4a1-891254af2174","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕の vim 、めちゃくちゃ古いけども。","ts":"1631140277.033200","t